:: OC Arthur Richard Hat Quest Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you walk down the hallway stifling a yawn and trying to get to your next class, you suddenly feel a tap on your shoulder. You turn to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> standing there, surprisingly without his other half. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>, got a minute?”</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">He asks with a nervous smile. His voices sounds a little stressed and he seems to have bags under his eyes.</span> Curious, you nod and follow <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> into the restrooms. He quickly checks the stalls to ensure they are empty before sighing. A bit confused about what’s going on, you ask him what’s up. <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Arthur",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Uniform",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, sorry. Just wanted to make sure <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richie</span> wasn’t around. Can’t spoil the surprise!”</span> He smiles, reaching into his bag and pulling out some rough drawings, handing them to you. You inspect the crude pencil sketches to see they were designs for some sort of hat? One with pointed ears and white fluff at the top. You ask him what this is for and he smiles proudfully. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Our anniversary is coming up, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richie</span> and mine’s, and this is my present to him. He’s always talking about how much he loves this hat a character from a game we play wears. Soooo, I decided to put my endless talents to use and make him one. Aren’t I a great boyfriend?”</span> You chuckle, handing back the paper and claiming you didn’t know he was skilled enough in sewing to make something like that. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, it hasn’t been easy. That’s for sure… that’s actually why I’m here…”</span> He rubs the back of his head nervously, getting to the point of this secret meeting. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I managed to get a prototype together, to ensure I got the design down. Then I started working on the full thing. And it was coming along great, it really was! Until… until Buchi got a hold of it…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> sighs, slumping his shoulders. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s my dog. I left the hat on my bed while I ate dinner and he must have thought it was a toy or something. Tore it to shreds, even ate the buttons!”</span> You nod along, saying you feel sorry for his loss, but are still unsure where you come in. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I went to the craft store for replacements, but they were out of the buttons I need and of the white fur for the top! They said they won’t get anymore until after our anniversary!”</span> He grabs you arms desperately, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’ve got to help me find the pieces I need, please! I know you’re super smart and resourceful and my brain is a mess just thinking about how disappointed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richie</span> will be if I don’t get it ready in time! I’ve been hyping up his gift all month! Please, you’ve got to help me!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> begins to sob in your arms, begging for your help. <br>
<br>

<div id="Choice1">
	<<link "How are you supposed to help?<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        You ask him how you’re supposed to help and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> perks up instantly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So, you’ll help me? Oh, thank you, thank you!”</span> He jumps up and down hugging you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I mainly need another pair of eyes, good eyes, like yours. Plus, someone who can think outside the box. So, you’ll be perfect!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> gives you another hug excitedly. You think about pointing out how you technically didn’t agree to help but figure it’s too late for that. <br>
        <br>
        <<include"OC Arthur Richard Hat Quest Intro 2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "What’s in it for you?<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        You ask him what’s in it for you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> perks up instantly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So, you’ll help me? Oh, thank you, thank you!”</span> He jumps up and down hugging you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you help me get this done, I’m sure both me and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richie</span> would want to reward you! And like you saw in the showers, we are really good at rewards!”</span> He laughs as you blush at the thought. <span style="color:Pink">Is he really offering ‘that’?</span> <br>
        <<set _arousalbp to []>>
        <<set _arousalkink to ["Preteens"]>>
        <<arousalGain 10 _arousalbp _arousalkink>>
        <br>
        <<include"OC Arthur Richard Hat Quest Intro 2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>

:: OC Arthur Richard Hat Quest Intro 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here’s the plan! Let’s met up at that playground by Northend, do you know it?”</span> He asks and you nod in response, claiming your house is nearby. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, nice! I think it’ll be a good spot. People leave stuff there all the time, so maybe we’ll get lucky. The other week I found a jacket there with a whole bunch of buttons! Wrong color, but I did keep them for practice.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> pauses for a moment, thinking, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“After that? Maybe we can check the Community Center or Thrift Store? Can always find good stuff there.”</span> <br>
<br>
You agree to the plan and ask what time you should meet. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Pretty early, so we have enough time to find everything. Maybe around 8? Before noon at the latest, I’d say.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> suddenly gives you another big hug, this one lifting you into the air, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks again! You’re the best! I promise we’ll find a great way to thank you for helping us!”</span> Putting you back down, you say goodbye to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> as he hurries off to his next class. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightGreen">Guess you’ll be helping the lovebirds this weekend.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Arthur" 3 1>>
<<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Arthur & Richard: Hat Quest")>>
